cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below."
title: "Montana Research Foundation Open Data: reproducibility bundles for the MRF preprints"
abstract: >-
  Per-rollout aggregate records and a self-contained verification script
  behind each Montana Research Foundation preprint. Task families, raw agent
  transcripts, and held-out grading data are withheld under contamination
  control (see each bundle's WITHHELD.md).
type: dataset
authors:
